{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Before? God, before was beautiful, I just didn't know it, I took it all for granted","Before? A job, a house, a dog, and a normal Tuesday night","It was so normal... so ordinary -- so boring, and I'd give anything to go back","Before... we had Sunday dinners, and barbecues, and fireworks, and neighbors","It's like another life, another world, another person, I barely remember her","Before was noise, traffic, TV, phones ringing, people complaining about nothing!","I remember a Saturday, a regular Saturday, my kid's soccer game, and I was annoyed about parking"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Before was easy, you just don't realize until it's gone","Life was simple, you got up, you worked, you ate, you slept, repeat","We complained about taxes, and traffic, and the weather, and now we'd kill for any of it","Before, I had a future... now I just have today","It was a good world, mostly, with some bad people in it, and now it's a bad world, with some good people in it"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Let me tell you about the best part of before, it was dinner, with everyone around the table","Before, I'd sit on the porch and listen to the cicadas, and now I listen for something else!!","Before wasn't perfect"},false,false,{[3]={{t="but it was ours",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Why? you want to rub it in?!","Before is gone, so shut up about it!","Before is gone, forget it"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"Before, we gathered on Sundays, and sang, and now we gather when we can","Folks came to me about money and their marriages, I'd love a marriage problem now"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral",{"Before, honey, I could walk to town, and chat with everyone I met"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Before? I used to complain about everything","Before was loud... and fast -- and full","Saturday mornings, cartoons, cereal","Before, I had a job I hated","Everyone had somewhere to be..","Before, I never noticed the quiet","Before, I took my breath for granted","It was ordinary","I miss before"},false,false,{[1]={{t="the traffic, the heat, my boss",afterMs=3500},{t="I'd kill to complain again",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="and I thought it was stressful",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="that's before to me",afterMs=3500}},[4]={{t="and a car I loved",afterMs=3200},{t="and a TV I fought over",afterMs=2800}},[5]={{t="now everyone has nowhere",afterMs=3500}},[8]={{t="and ordinary was a miracle",afterMs=3200}},[9]={{t="I miss it like a limb",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"Before, my biggest worry was a parking ticket"},false,false,{[1]={{t="ha, I'd frame one now",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Before? Before was steady paychecks, football on Sundays, my mama's pot roast, I was a different man","Before, I had a pickup, a trailer, and a dog named Duke, I'd trade my whole arsenal to have them back","Life before was boring, and I cursed it every day, God, I wish I could curse it now","Before the dead came, I was a nobody, a face in a crowd, I kind of like being somebody, even if it's this"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Before's gone, quit bringing it up!"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"It was a good life, honestly, I just didn't know it, you never do, do you?","I had a girl, Sarah, she made the best banana pudding, I think about it every night"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Before? School, the block, my crew, my mama's cooking, I thought it was hard, {g:man|lady}, I had no idea","Before, we had parties on the corner, music till dawn, cops rolling by, those were the days","It was good, it really was, I didn't know how good"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Before, I was gonna go to community college and study music, can you believe that?"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Before, it was the open road, a cold beer at sunset, and nobody asking questions","Before, I rode wherever I wanted, {g:brother|sister}, that's all I had","I had a garage, a wife, a bike, I miss all three equally"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Before, I used to coach Little League, don't laugh, I was damn good at it"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Before, it was dinners, deals, a certain elegance that is now gone forever","Life before was orderly, predictable, and quite profitable"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I miss the opera, honestly, had season tickets in Louisville"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Before? Before I got locked up? I had a job, a wife, a dog, I screwed it all up","Before was a long time ago, I barely remember, only the smell of my mom's kitchen"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"I painted houses, was good at it too, miss the smell of fresh paint"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Had a cabin, a truck, a woman who loved me... now I've got the rifle","Before was simpler, I hunted, I fished, I sat on the porch, and that was enough"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Before, I taught my grandson to fish, I sure hope he's okay"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Before, I wrote parking tickets and broke up bar fights, I'd give anything to go back","Before this, my biggest worry was paperwork, and I used to complain about it"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=law|st=friendly",{"Before, I coached my daughter's softball team, we lost every game and I loved it"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Before, I was stationed in Germany, good beer, good food, good friends","Before, I just wanted to finish my enlistment and go home, now I just want to go home"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Before, I played guitar in a band, we weren't good, but we had fun"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"Before, I was in high school, I had a girlfriend, a car, a future, now I have a rifle"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Before, it was church picnics and Friday night football, I miss it all","Before was seed catalogs and county fair ribbons, simple, honest, good"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Before, I sang tenor in the choir, we were pretty good, if I do say so myself"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","st=friendly,neutral",{"Saying later to somebody who deserved a minute of my time","Mistaking being right for being decent. Did that more than once","Not asking somebody why they were upset. I decided I already knew","I should've said thank you without making a joke afterward","Trying to win a conversation that wasn't supposed to be a fight","I spent too long waiting to feel brave before I said something kind","There are things I'd change. I don't know whether I'd change them well","I wish I'd listened when somebody said they were tired. I thought everybody was"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","st=neutral,careful",{"I've got enough. I'd rather not make a performance of them","I'd tell you one if I thought you wanted to know me, not judge me"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I was a cashier at the grocery in {town}, knew everybody's usual - Mrs. Tate got two cans of salmon every Thursday","Normal - boring, church on Sunday, pot roast after - I used to complain about how boring it was - God","I was starting at the community college in August - nursing, I already bought the white shoes"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family|role=family_man,family_woman,civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"We had a pool in the backyard, above ground, but it was a pool, the kids were in it every day since school let out"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Before? I ran the feed store forty years, before was knowing what tomorrow looked like"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"Worked, came home, drank a beer on the porch and watched the bugs go around the light - didn't know I was rich"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|world=road",{"Before, I didn't have strangers asking me personal questions in the road - keep your distance"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Before, you'd get arrested for walking up on me like this - now I handle it myself"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Twenty years at the distillery, whole town smelled like sour mash, I used to hate that smell"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=rescue|role=rescue_firefighter,rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Before, a bad night was a pileup on the interstate - I'd give a lot for a plain old pileup now"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=rescue|role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"Before, my biggest fight was whether the choir robes should be blue or maroon - maroon won, I miss that fight"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Traffic stops, domestic calls, a stolen riding mower every other week - I was bored silly, I'd love to be bored","Coffee at the diner on Main at six, patrol, lunch in the same booth - waitress had my order up before I sat down"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"Before or now, the rule's the same - keep your hands where I can see them"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=military|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I was in high school, like, last year - Junior prom was in the gym, I had a rented tux that didn't fit"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=military,elite|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Before was training for a war that already ended, this is the one that showed up"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Deployments, same as now - different threat"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=military,elite|st=careful,hostile",{"Before doesn't matter, the line is now - move"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=outlaw,crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Same as now, only with more cops and less room to breathe","Ran a little business out of my garage - mostly legal, sold a whole lot of radar detectors"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Before, I had a cell with a bunk and a steel toilet - now I got the whole county, that's an upgrade"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=raider,gang,club|st=friendly,neutral",{"Before, people like you locked their car doors when they saw me coming - now it don't help"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful",{"What I did before ain't none of your concern"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Before you showed up, I was having a nice day"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Boring - God, it was so boring, I'd give anything for a boring Tuesday"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"Softball on Wednesdays, whole town came out - I miss the standing around most..."}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"Clock in, clock out, complain about the foreman, I'd clock in right now"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","role=rescue_medical|st=neutral",{"Twelve-hour shifts and a bad back, I complained about it constantly - constantly"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","role=rescue_firefighter|st=neutral|world=trees",{"Grass fires, cats in trees, one bad wreck a year - that was a full year for us"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"Pumping gas and arguing about the Derby, somebody won it - I can't recall who"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","role=family_elder|st=neutral|mood=sad|world=inside",{"Sunday dinner, fourteen at the table, now that table's the biggest thing in here"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"Speeding tickets and barking dogs, I used to think that was real police work"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral|world=building,road",{"Forty-one years on the same road, I knew every mailbox, still do, for all the good"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Fort Knox, five days a week, home for supper, best boring job in America"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","role=soldier_green|tmp=fresh|st=neutral",{"Basic, two weeks home, then here, that's my whole life - it ain't much of a story"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=elite|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Different countries, same work, this is the first time it's been at home"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=club|st=neutral|mood=funny",{"Ride Friday, sleep Saturday, fix the bike Sunday, same as now, minus the sleeping"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","role=crime_member|st=neutral",{"I was in business - different product, same customers, mostly"}},
{"ASK_BEFORE","reg=raider,gang,prison|tmp=predator|st=hostile|world=road",{"Before? I was nobody, now folks cross the road when they see me, I ain't going back"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,5",{"If you think you've been bitten, tell somebody. Don't hide it out of fear","If something happened, give whoever's helping you an honest account"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,5",{"Let me see your arms - calm - slow, roll up your sleeves"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"BITTEN?! Please, don't shout that. You're scaring me!","God, please, slow down. I don't know how to answer you","I'd want somebody to know if something happened. I wouldn't want to face it alone","Please, ask before you touch me. I'm frightened enough","I keep checking. I wish that made me feel less afraid","Bitten?! Please, don't ask it like you've already decided!","Please believe I don't want to hurt you. I'm scared too","Why are you asking me that?! What did you notice?","I wash everything, I keep checking. I'm trying, all right?"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'd appreciate you giving me a little space before you ask that again","Every little scrape frightens me now. I don't pretend to know what matters","Checked when I woke up, checked at lunch, I'll check again before I sleep, I'm always checking","You can ask to look. Just don't grab at me","You want to look? Ask me first. Don't grab at me","You can ask to check. I don't mind if we're careful","I've been lucky, or careful. I hope it's enough"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Don't feel bad about asking. I'm scared of the answer too","I get why you'd ask. Let's talk without frightening each other","Good thing you asked, folks should be checking","Please, ask before you start looking me over. I get why you're worried","God, I've tried to be careful. Don't turn this into a threat","I check myself every night. It never quite settles my mind","There's a lot of fear in that question. Mine as well as yours"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"How dare you ask me that?","Keep your distance while we talk about this, all right?","Do I look bitten? mind your own business","Back off. We can talk without you crowding me","Back off. I'm worried about you crowding me","Are YOU? Roll your sleeves up first, then we'll talk about me - well?"},false,{[6]="SHOW_ARMS"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"We can talk about checking each other. Ask first, that's all","Working around wounds makes me careful. It doesn't make me certain about everything","Frightened patients can scratch. I try to take every injury seriously"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"I pray for anybody facing that. I really do"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"Do you want an answer, or do you want to frighten me?"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'd rather be careful than sound certain","That's a frightening question to have to answer","Look, look at my arms","I don't want to give you a promise I can't check","I'd tell you if I were","I'm paranoid about every scrape now","I want you to believe me. I don't know how to make that enough","Please, give me a second to think"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I check every night, head to toe",afterMs=3500},{t="I don't want to miss anything",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="scratched, once, on a nail",afterMs=3200},{t="I washed it with whiskey",afterMs=2800}},[3]={{t="take a proper look, please",afterMs=3500},{t="you can check my legs, too",afterMs=3000}},[5]={{t="I'd walk away myself",afterMs=3200}},[6]={{t="I scrub them raw",afterMs=3500}},[8]={{t="I have dreams that I am, though",afterMs=3200},{t="I wake up checking",afterMs=2800}}}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"My sister's dog tried to eat my shoe in 1983. Not the answer you wanted, I know","I miss when that question was a joke about mosquitoes"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"BITTEN?! Keep your voice down. You know what people do when they hear that!","You asking because you're worried, or looking for a reason to hurt me?","I'd want to be honest about it. I'm scared of what honesty would cost","Check me yourself if you want, go ahead, I've got nothing to hide","Careful how you ask that, people have been shot for less"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Say that again and I'll put you in the ground!"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"I'm so careful. I keep checking myself. Doesn't stop me worrying","I don't know how long anybody's luck holds. I'm trying to stay careful"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Keep talking like that and we'll have a different problem","You can ask to look, {g:man|lady}. Don't put your hands on me","Standing here talking doesn't prove much, does it? That's what scares me","My cousin got bit, so I check every inch of me every morning"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"You calling me infected?! I'll shoot you where you stand!"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"It scares me to death, honestly. I don't like thinking about it"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"I'd want to keep other people safe if something happened","Ask before you check anybody, {g:brother|sister}. Fear isn't permission","I'd rather keep a little distance than pretend I'm certain"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Watch your mouth, {g:boy|girl}, or I'll shut it for you"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=club|st=friendly",{"I keep praying we all get through without finding out"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I take great care. That isn't the same as a guarantee","I've had my shirt off four times today, simply to check"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"The thought haunts me. I wish you'd asked something easier"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"N-no, please, don't hurt me over a question!","On my mother's grave, I don't want to hurt anybody. Give me a moment","Every night I strip down and check myself, every night, I'm so scared"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Don't point anything at me. You're not going to get an answer that way"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"You can ask to check. Just let me think before you crowd me"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"I try to be careful. I hope that still counts for something","Take a look if you like, I've got nothing to hide"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"You ought to ask, friend. Just ask carefully"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"I try to keep checking. I won't call that a guarantee","We should take the question seriously, not guess at an answer","My partner was bitten. I won't take the question lightly"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Do I look infected to you? Keep your hands where I can see them!"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=law|st=friendly",{"We're all worried about this. Give me a little space"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"A uniform isn't a medical guarantee. Be careful around everybody","Checking matters. So does admitting what we can't know"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=military|st=hostile",{"That's an insulting question, civilian!"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=military|st=friendly",{"We try to be careful. I'd rather not promise more than that"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"God, I keep checking every morning. I hate how frightened I am"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"We try to look after each other. Nobody gets a guarantee"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Look if we agree to it. Don't assume anybody's safe just because they say so"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=careful",{"Don't come near me. We can ask questions from there"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=careful,neutral",{"Stay where you are. Let's be careful with each other"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Lord, honey, it's a terrible thing to have to wonder about"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Would looking put your mind at ease? We'd have to agree how","I keep checking, but I'm not asking you to trust a slogan","We can talk about checking each other, {sir}. Carefully, and only if we agree","I take the question seriously. Don't assume a uniform means an all clear"},false,{[3]="SHOW_ARMS"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral|hour=4,11",{"I won't give you a medical all clear just because I sound calm"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Ha. You want to check? Ask nicely, at least","Being quick isn't a guarantee. Wish it was"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Mind your business. You don't get every answer you ask for","Do I look dead to you?"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=worst",{"Bitten? Why? What makes you ask? Keep a little distance"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=neutral",{"Why? What did you notice that worries you?","Don't touch me. You want to ask something, ask from there"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=family|st=friendly",{"Heavens, dear. Could we talk about this calmly?"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=law,swat|st=careful",{"You step back. We can agree how to check without threatening each other"}},
