{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral,careful",{"Please, don't decide what you think before I answer. Give me a moment"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Even an ordinary scratch frightens me now. I don't want to guess about one","I keep going over every close call in my head. It never makes me certain","You want to ask to see my arms? I wouldn't blame you for asking"},false,{[3]="SHOW_ARMS"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"You can ask to look, from there. Then we'll agree what happens next","If I knew something was wrong, I'd want somebody to know. That's what I hope I'd do"},false,{[1]="SHOW_ARMS"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Ask me that again and you'll be the one bleeding"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=rescue|role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'd want someone who knows what they're looking at. I'm not guessing about wounds"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=rescue|role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"I check myself every night. Old nurse habit. Still doesn't make me know everything"}},
{"ASK_BITTEN","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'll talk if it eases your mind. People need their minds eased right now"},false,{[1]="SHOW_ARMS"}},
