{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Fuel? You want fuel? You can have a face full of exhaust"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","st=friendly,neutral",{"A full tank is a rare thing now, I can't help you"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","st=careful",{"Keep your hands off my car and we won't have a problem"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","role=worker",{"Check the depots, the garages, the equipment yards, diesel's easier to find than gas.."}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","role=civilian_loner",{"I use a mule now, you don't have to find gas for a mule"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Gas? I don't have a car, I take theirs","Fuel's gold now, you think I'd tell you where to find it?","There's a tank of diesel at the farm south of here, but I'd tell you wrong if you asked nicely","I siphon what I need, and I don't share the spot, or the hose","Car? Keys went missing three days ago, don't ask"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Gas? I'll show you where to get gas, down a well, headfirst!"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Honestly? I haven't found any in days, and it's killing me"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Car? We had one, ran out of gas on day two","Gas station on the corner has been picked clean","My boy knows where to find fuel, but he ain't telling","Every tank on this side of town been drained by us - you're riding a bicycle"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Fuel? Stay out of our way and you'll keep what you have"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Could use gas myself, you find any, tell me"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Bike runs on fumes, {g:brother|sister}, I'm hoarding every drop","Gas station on the highway got hit hard, nothing left","Siphoned my last drop from a wreck, you'll have to do the same"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Gas is mine, hands off","Ask about the club's gas again and you'll walk the rest of your short life"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=club|st=friendly",{"I've got a couple of gallons, we might make a trade"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Fuel is an asset, and I don't discuss assets","I could arrange some, at market price, which has risen sharply"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Perhaps we can come to an arrangement"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful|world=trees",{"I don't have a car, I walk, nobody can follow footsteps in the woods"}},
