{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Fuel is not for you, move along"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Sorry, friend, it's all accounted for"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","role=soldier_nco|st=neutral,careful",{"Fuel is life, and I won't waste any"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"I don't know where the fuel is, they never tell us anything"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"Fuel's money, same as anything else"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"We've got diesel for the tractor, but it's precious","Old Pete has a barrel in his barn, but he guards it"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=neutral,friendly",{"Our station wagon ran dry on 31W with the kids in the back - we walked from there, it's still sitting on the shoulder"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=neutral,friendly",{"I have a car but I can't drive it, the noise brings them - I just sit in it sometimes - sorry"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=careful,hostile",{"Don't you even look at my truck, it's all we've got to get out of here"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Siphon from the cars on the bridge, garden hose, get it started, don't swallow - everybody swallows the first time"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=civilian,worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"Gas station tanks are underground, pumps need power - figure out a hand pump and you're a rich man"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=family|role=family_elder|st=friendly",{"Lawnmower gas in the shed, maybe a gallon, it's got oil mixed in - your engine won't thank you"}},
