{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=raider,prison,gang|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Gas? Sure, I'll pour it on you and see how bright you burn"}},
{"ASK_CAR_FUEL","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"Bikes sip gas, we found a tanker - that's all I'll say, and I already said too much"}},
