{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Where? WHERE?! I don't know, nobody does, I've heard six different stories and they all end with me hiding in a closet","Rabies -- I think, the doctor on the radio said something like rabies, but a bad kind, a super kind","Some chemical, a truck went over on the highway, that's what my brother-in-law says, he's an idiot, but who knows","The Army did it, that's what everyone says, an experiment, a test, and it got out, and now look","Bad water -- or bad meat, or a bad batch of something at the plant, I don't know, I'm no scientist","It's a virus, it has to be, a virus that comes with a bite, that's all they said before it went dark","Honestly? God, I think... we did something and this is His answer, I know, not helpful","Some kind of disease from overseas -- they were talking about it in the spring, remember? a fever in some jungle","Why does it matter? it's HERE, it's in my yard, it's at my door, I don't care where it came from!","I heard Russia... I heard terrorists, I heard aliens, I heard it's the Second Coming, take your pick"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Could've been anything, a lab leak, a bad batch of vaccine, a bite from the wrong bat, we'll never know","Doesn't matter anymore... knowing wouldn't put one single body back in the ground..","Heard it started in a hospital, one patient, and a nurse who never washed her hands, or didn't know to","Someone said it's a government weapon gone wrong, I'd bet my last can that's true","Nature, I guess, nature's been trying to wipe us out since the beginning","Virus, bacteria, parasite, call it what you want, it makes the dead walk, that's the only fact I need","There's a rumor about a shipment that came through the base... a crate that wasn't supposed to be opened","It came out of nowhere... like a bad dream, and the only thing that's sure is it's real","I used to wonder, now I just try to stay breathing, the why is somebody else's problem"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"It's only been days -- they're saying it could be a new strain of flu, or something in the water supply!","The radio says \"unknown pathogen,\" what the hell is an unknown pathogen?"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|day=15,9999",{"Weeks later... and still nobody knows, if the scientists knew, we'd have heard, wouldn't we","After all this time, I think the people who knew are dead, and the ones who are left don't know either"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Why do you want to know? does it change anything?","Ask the government, not me","I don't have answers, and I wouldn't tell you if I did","Ask the people in charge!!","It's none of my concern!","Ask the ones who did it","Who knows!","Does it matter?","Beats me","I'll talk about germs when I know you're not carrying any - stay back there"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=rescue_medical",{"Bite or deep scratch, fluid contact, I've seen it in the blood within hours, past that it's guesswork","It acts like rabies, but it isn't, rabies takes weeks, this takes hours, and rabies doesn't reanimate","Whatever it is, it hits the nervous system first, then the heart stops... and then it doesn't","I've been hearing \"lab accident,\" but frankly I've also heard \"meteorite,\" so, I don't put much stock"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=rescue_clergy",{"Some say judgment, and I don't know, I won't claim to know the mind of God","Sin, science, plain bad luck, I couldn't tell you... I just walk through it with folks"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=militia",{"Rumor around the post is a chemical weapon stored at the base, a leak, or sabotage, nobody confirms anything","Army says nothing, so I assume it's the Army, that's the usual pattern"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=civilian_loner",{"I've seen enough dead animals this year to say it started in the woods, with a tick, or a bat, or a worm","Farmers say the cattle got sick first, then the dogs... must be in the ground, the grass"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Somebody says it's the water","I heard a plant spilled something","Maybe it was God","A scientist on TV said the first day... \"We don't know\"","It came out of nowhere","I think somebody opened the wrong door","Rabies, they said, at first","My uncle says the Russians","It doesn't matter anymore","I believe in bad luck"},false,false,{[1]={{t="somebody says it's the air",afterMs=3500},{t="somebody says it's us",afterMs=3000}},[2]={{t="I heard a lab did",afterMs=3200},{t="I heard a lot",afterMs=2800}},[3]={{t="maybe it was a mistake",afterMs=3500},{t="maybe it was both",afterMs=3000}},[4]={{t="the first honest thing I heard",afterMs=3500}},[5]={{t="and it'll go to the same place, if we're lucky",afterMs=3200}},[6]={{t="somewhere",afterMs=3500},{t="and it's still open",afterMs=3000}},[7]={{t="then they stopped saying anything",afterMs=3200}},[8]={{t="my aunt says aliens",afterMs=3500},{t="my cousin says it's the Mormons",afterMs=3000}},[9]={{t="the damage is done",afterMs=3200}},[10]={{t="I think this is the worst kind",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"Obviously, it's my ex-wife!","Somebody ate bad potato salad at a picnic","My theory? Bad potato salad"},false,false,{[1]={{t="she's always wanted me dead",afterMs=3200}},[2]={{t="that's my theory",afterMs=3200}},[3]={{t="nobody's disproved it",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Does it help to know?"},false,false,{[1]={{t="it doesn't help me",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,3",{"They'll announce the cause tomorrow, I'm sure","It's some kind of fever"},false,false,{[1]={{t="a chemical spill, they said",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="the news said it, before it went dark",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,14",{"Nobody knows...","The rumors multiply"},false,false,{[1]={{t="scientists, doctors, preachers, all guessing",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="it's the water, it's the air, it's the Army",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=15,99999",{"It stopped mattering","After all this, who cares who started it?"},false,false,{[1]={{t="the cause is behind us, the effect is all around",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"I don't want to know, I really don't!"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"It doesn't bring them back, so I don't care"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"Somebody did this, somebody's fault, I'd like a name and an address"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Doesn't matter where it came from, it's here and I'm taking full advantage","Heard the Army did it, heard Russia did it, heard it was God -- pick one, I'm busy","Some fool in a lab dropped a test tube, if you ask me, but nobody asks","Bad meat at a church supper -- I'm kidding, but wouldn't that be a hell of a way to end the world?","Rabies, that's what I figure, you ever see a dog foam up? Same damn look","Judgment Day, the preacher in my hometown kept saying it, I laughed at him... I'm not laughing now","That chemical plant over by Brandenburg, you know they dump all kinds of crap, that's my bet","Who cares, who cares, who CARES where it came from, you wanna fix it with a speech?"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"You're asking ME? Do I look like a scientist?!","Cause? The cause is you wasting my time, and it's about to end"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"My cousin worked at the chemical plant and said there was a spill last month, maybe that's it","Honest answer? I think we did this to ourselves somehow, and it makes me sick","Waco, the bombing in New York, the war, hell, maybe the whole country's been sick for years"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Government, always the government, they been testing stuff on us for years","Some drug, some new thing that got loose, I don't know","My grandma says it's the Devil, and honestly I'm starting to believe her","Something in the water, we always said the water tasted weird","They say it's like that hantavirus out west, but worse, way worse","Man, every day I hear a new story, aliens, radiation, whatever, none of it brings my people back"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Who cares, it's here now!"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I've heard everything and nobody knows for sure, and that scares me worse than the dead"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Probably some corporation cutting corners, always is","The Army was running tests at the base, everybody around here knows that","Somebody dumped something in the river, I'd bet my patch on it","Gulf War vets been getting sick for two years, nobody ever said why, maybe this is the same","Like I know? I fix engines, I don't read science magazines"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Does it matter? It's here and we're fighting it"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Rabies, maybe, some new strain, I'm no doctor but it's the closest thing I can think of"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"I have heard three versions, each more convenient than the last","A shipment, a lab, a leak -- everyone has a favorite, nobody has proof","Corporate negligence, most likely, it's always about the money","The people who could answer are the ones who aren't talking","Interesting question, and the answer is expensive, and I don't have it"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I hope someone is working on an answer, because it certainly isn't me"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Prison water, we all got sick first, swear to God that's where it started","Don't know, don't care, I just want it to be over","Maybe the food, maybe the air, maybe the ink in the pens, I don't know","Doesn't matter, nothing ever changed for guys like me, now it's changed for everybody"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"How should I know?! I was locked up!"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"God's punishment, maybe, I've done enough wrong to believe it"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Government mistake, probably, they always screw something up","A bug, a bad batch, a jar of something nasty, I really couldn't tell you","Nobody knows, and the ones who do aren't talking","Too many people, too many chemicals, too much of everything, and it finally broke","My granddad used to say the Lord would call time on us someday, guess he was right"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=outlaw|st=hostile",{"Is that what you came to ask me?"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"Rumor has it, an experiment, but who knows"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"I saw things at the base, I can't talk about it, they'd find me"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"No official cause, only speculation","CDC was supposed to send people, they never made it here, so your guess is as good as mine","Prevailing theory is a virus, but nobody's shown me any proof","Everybody wants a reason, I just want an off switch"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=law|st=hostile",{"That's not for you to speculate about"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=law|st=friendly",{"No one knows, but I've heard everything -- bad water, bad food, bad luck"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"Some say biological, some say divine, I'm just trying to keep order"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Nobody told us, we just kept getting sent out","Official line is a pathogen of unknown origin","They told us it was contained, obviously it wasn't"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Not authorized to discuss"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=military|st=friendly",{"Honestly? I wish I knew, because then maybe I could sleep"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=soldier_nco|st=neutral,careful",{"Doesn't matter where it came from, it matters how we stop it"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"First I heard chemical, then a virus, now... I don't know, everybody's got a story"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"Someone sold something to someone who shouldn't have bought it"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Government, Wall Street, the Devil -- the pastor says it's sin, and I'm starting to think he's right","Bad water, I'd say, the creek's been running funny for weeks"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=militia|st=friendly",{"We pray about it, friend, every night"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"My brother-in-law swears it's the Army, something got out of a lab on post and they're keeping it quiet","Rabies, chemicals, who knows... I just want somebody to tell us the truth","Pastor Glenn said it was judgment, then Pastor Glenn got bit on the church steps, so I don't know anymore"},false,{[2]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,5",{"The man on the radio called it a flu that makes people aggressive - a flu! Like we'd all just need some soup"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Doesn't matter where it came from, matters where it's going, and that's wherever you're standing","I heard Army, I heard Russians, I heard bad well water - ain't one of those theories stopped a single one of them"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral|world=door",{"Virus, poison, God - pick one, they all end the same way at the back door"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker|st=careful",{"Why do you care where it came from? You been around sick people? Roll your sleeves up"},false,{[1]="SHOW_ARMS"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile|world=road",{"Came from people like you wandering up and breathing on folks - get off my road"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Guys at the plant said a tanker jackknifed out by the base back in June, and nobody ever said what was in it - I think about that a lot","It came from somewhere up the chain, same as everything - us on the floor just get it when it rolls downhill"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=rescue|role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"Blood-borne from what I saw, a bite or deep scratch and fever in a day, hospital never had a name for it"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=rescue|role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"We hosed down a house full of them on Tuesday - whatever it is, it's not smoke and it's not any chemical I've got a card for"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=rescue|role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"People keep asking me if God sent it, I tell them God isn't the one doing the biting"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"{sir}, I wasn't told, and I was in uniform, that ought to tell you how much anybody knew"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"State said communicable disease, that's all that came over the teletype before the lines went down","Best I can figure, it started out near the base - first bite calls came from out that way"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"I'm not here to discuss theories - step back from me"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"Nobody briefed us on origin, we were told blood and saliva, and to keep our sleeves rolled down","Rumor in the company was a research facility, rumor in the company is also that we all go home Sunday"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=elite",{"Origin is above my clearance - transmission isn't - don't get bit"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=military,elite|st=careful,hostile",{"That's not information I can give you, move along"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=military|role=deserter",{"They know, the brass knew before the first roadblock went up, that's why I walked"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=outlaw,raider,crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Government cooked it up and lost the lid, always figured they'd kill us one way or another"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Doc in the infirmary said it was in the water - Doc in the infirmary also ate his own finger, so"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=gang,club|st=friendly,neutral",{"Who cares? Maybe God got tired of Kentucky, I ain't asking questions, I'm taking inventory"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"It came from asking too many questions - want to catch some?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"You want science, go find a scientist, they're the ones walking around with their guts hanging out","Keep your mouth shut and your feet moving, that's all the cause you need to understand"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Nobody knows, that's what I can't get past, nobody knows and it's been nine days"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=family|st=neutral|mood=funny",{"My brother-in-law says the Army, my sister says God - they ain't spoke since Tuesday"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|world=water",{"There's a plant up the river, everybody's got their plant they blame"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=rescue_medical|st=neutral",{"It moves like a bite infection and nothing else about it does - that's all I'll swear to"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"Folks want a reason so bad they'll take a bad one - I'd rather sit with not knowing"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"Rabies, they said on the fifth - rabies, said it on the radio with a straight face"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral",{"Eleven theories this month, and every one came from somebody with no news"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Nobody's told me a damn thing, anybody says different is making it up"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","role=elite_delta|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"I wasn't briefed, that's either the truth or the most useful lie I've got"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=raider,gang|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Who cares where it come from? It came, best thing ever happened to me"}},
{"ASK_CAUSE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=hostile|mood=angry|world=building",{"Does it matter? Does knowing put my wife back in that kitchen?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"The checkpoint? don't go, they'll turn you around, or worse, they shot at a family last week","They've blocked the bridge... with concrete -- with trucks, with soldiers, nobody gets across","I- it's closed -- all closed, sealed, I tried, they yelled at me through a megaphone","Roadblock on every main road, soldiers in masks, asking for papers, what papers?","Some guys with rifles set one up at the corner, they're not Army, I don't know what they are"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Checkpoints are traps, either Army, or locals, or thieves, and you can't tell until you're close","They search you, they take your stuff, they send you back, if you're lucky","Don't bring anything you can't lose, and don't say anything you can't take back","They let medical cases through, once, but not anymore","I counted four on the way here, each one meaner than the last"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Why? you running from something?","Go and see, I won't stop you","I stay away from them, and so should you"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=militia",{"Our checkpoint is for protection, not detention, and if you cooperate, no one gets hurt"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=civilian_loner",{"I go around, always around, through the fields, through the woods, under the wire"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=worker",{"Truck drivers tell me the interstate is a parking lot with armed guards"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Checkpoint? That's a toll booth, {g:pal|lady}, and I'm the toll collector","Who's at the roadblock? Whoever has the guns, today that's us","Blocked? It's blocked because it's profitable, you see?","The Army set up a roadblock, we set up another, now everyone's collecting something","Pay or turn around, those are the options, and the second one isn't popular"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Checkpoint? You're standing in it!"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Honestly? It's a mess, nobody knows who's in charge, I went around it through the fields"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Checkpoint? Man, the cops had one, then the Army, then us, now nobody","Roadblock at the interchange, don't go, they'll rob you blind","Who's at the checkpoint? Anyone with a gun and a bad attitude"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"The checkpoint's mine, and it's closed to you!"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I can show you a way around it, if you promise not to tell"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Roadblock on the highway is Army, they turn everyone back, no exceptions","We run a toll on the county road, small, fair, keeps the peace","Checkpoints are the only thing that works, {g:brother|sister}, nobody wants chaos"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Checkpoint's closed to the likes of you!"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=club|st=friendly",{"They know me at the roadblock, I could get you through, for a favor"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Checkpoints are an administrative inconvenience, I know how to circumvent them","Passage can be arranged, with the right people"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I'll see what I can do for you"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"No, no, I stay away from checkpoints, they check ID, they check faces","I saw soldiers at one, a mile from here, I went the other way"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Don't take me to a checkpoint!"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"I know a back way, but it's through the woods, and it's scary"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"There's three between here and the county line, I know how to dodge each one","Army holds the main road, deputies hold the secondary, nobody holds the creek"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"I'll walk you around it, friend, it's a long way, but it's safe"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Checkpoints are established to control the spread, please comply with instructions","County deputies are manning the roadblock on the highway, it's temporary","We can't let anyone through without clearance, I'm sorry","I can't vouch for a roadblock I haven't checked"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Checkpoint rules apply, comply or be detained"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=law|st=friendly",{"I'd let you pass if I could, truly, but orders are orders"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=law_corrections|st=neutral,careful",{"I've stood at three checkpoints this week, and every one of them was a nightmare"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Checkpoint is under military control, state your business","Civilians are not permitted beyond the barrier","The roadblock is a quarantine measure, there are no exceptions"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Turn back immediately, or you will be detained!"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=military|st=friendly",{"I hate this part of the job, but I have to turn you around, I'm sorry"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=soldier_nco|st=neutral,careful",{"I run this checkpoint, and I run it by the book, no exceptions"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"I'm on checkpoint duty, I'm so scared of making a mistake, I'm sorry"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Our men hold the county road, we check everybody, no exceptions","Checkpoints keep out the raiders, but they also keep out good folks, it breaks my heart"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=militia|st=friendly",{"We'll let you through if you're peaceful, just leave your weapons with us"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Checkpoints? Ugh, don't ask, they stop everyone, ask a hundred questions, then maybe let you through","I hear they're turning folks back, and shooting those who argue, I'd avoid them if I were you","Roadblocks everywhere, it's like they don't want anyone to leave, not that anyone could","Be polite, hands visible, don't make sudden moves, that's the only advice I've got"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral",{"Don't ask me about checkpoints, I want nothing to do with them"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=family|st=friendly",{"Those soldiers are just boys, scared boys, be kind to them and they'll be kind back, mostly"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=law,swat|st=friendly",{"Just routine, do what we ask and you'll be on your way","We've got a few, and we're strict, nobody wants a bite getting through"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=law,swat|st=careful,neutral",{"That's official business, move along"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=military,elite|st=friendly",{"Checkpoints are in place for containment, comply and you'll pass","Do not approach armed, state your business, wait for clearance"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=military,elite|st=careful,neutral",{"Restricted information, step back"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly",{"Checkpoints? Ha, I go around them, they're full of sheep with guns","Don't bother, they'll just rob you, legally"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"What do you care? You planning something?"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=law,swat|st=careful",{"Checkpoints are for people who behave"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=military,elite|st=careful",{"Comply and you'll pass"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful",{"Avoid them, they're traps"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Why, so you can sneak past it? Not telling"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=military,elite|st=hostile",{"Restricted information"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Checkpoints? We rob them, ha"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","st=friendly,neutral",{"I don't have a confirmed checkpoint to send you to"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","st=careful|world=cars,road",{"A few cars across a road don't tell you who's giving the orders"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","st=hostile",{"Looking for permission to pass? You won't find it in this conversation"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=neutral,friendly",{"I'd like somebody official to tell me which way is alright - I really would"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=military,swat,elite|st=neutral,careful",{"No verified passage, do not assume a uniform means an open route"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'd rather say I don't know than send you into a standoff"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=worker|st=neutral",{"Nobody ever built a roadblock to make a trip easier"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=club,outlaw,crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Ask who's collecting the toll before you start counting your change"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=prison,gang,raider|st=careful,hostile",{"Some people call it a checkpoint because it sounds nicer than what it is"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly",{"They turned us around at the county line, not mean about it, just turned us around"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly|world=vehicle",{"They took our names on a clipboard and said wait in the car - we waited six hours"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"They'll want your hands - show 'em before they ask and the whole thing goes quicker"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle",{"They let the ambulance through on the sixth, not the seventh, nothing changed but the day"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly",{"A boy of nineteen with a rifle told me to go home - he called me sir, he was shaking"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly",{"Wave from far off - stop when they say stop - don't get out - don't reach for nothing"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral",{"They asked my temperature like I'd know it, I said warm, that's all I knew"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"They run a thermometer on you, anybody warm goes in the second line - don't be warm"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"That's the Guard, not us, they don't take our calls and we quit taking theirs"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral",{"Two conversations through a rifle scope this month, both with our own Army"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral|world=road",{"Roadblock procedure, they wave, they call out, then they fire on the road - in that order"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=soldier_green|tmp=fresh|st=neutral",{"I stood one for two days, I still don't know what I was supposed to be stopping"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=elite|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"A static post is men told what to do and never told why - behave accordingly"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=club|st=neutral|hour=16,22",{"Rode up on one at dusk, they put six lights on me - I turned around real slow"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=crime_member|st=neutral",{"There's a man at one post takes whiskey for a slow look - I didn't say which post"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=mercenary|st=neutral",{"Been through four, three took a bribe - one took my rifle, cost of doing business"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|world=road",{"They bulldozed the road behind theirs, even if they let you by, you can't come back"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=family,civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|world=cars",{"Bridge is blocked with two dump trucks and a wire - the wire's the part folks miss"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=careful",{"Don't drive at it, there's a car out there that drove at it and it's still sitting there"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"I go around - always around, nobody at a roadblock has ever been glad to see me"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=law_trooper|st=careful",{"They don't recognize my badge, I learned that at forty feet with my hands up"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=swat|st=careful|hour=7,18",{"On foot, in daylight, hands empty, talking the whole way - or don't approach at all"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=deserter|st=careful",{"I stood on one, then I walked off one, that's all I'll say, if it's alright with you"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","role=militia|st=careful",{"Ours is a gate and a bell, theirs is a wire and a machine gun, know which you're at"}},
{"ASK_CHECKPOINT","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=careful|mood=sad",{"They wouldn't take my daughter, said she had a cough - she's had that cough since May"}},
